            "review_title": "Review at Golden Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Lê Hồng vy\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\nOn weekends, I tell my mom to go eat Pho Sen, mom, we all go out to eat every week\nSep 2023 • Family\nMy whole family really likes breakfast dishes, but each person has their own taste, my family chooses Pho Sen, because of all the varieties:\n- First son: choose beef noodle soup\n- Youngest child: choose pho\n- Dad chose rib noodles\n- Mom chooses: Hue beef noodle soup\nAfter eating, I also got delicious ice cream, my two kids loved it\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten September 20, 2023\nGolden Marketing\nXin chào,\nCảm ơn bạn đã review trải nghiệm của bạn tại Phở Sen. Hân hạnh được đón tiếp bạn trong thời gian tới ạ.\nRead more\nWritten September 22, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
